  "content": "<p>這個模組新增了<strong>巨大的恐怖南瓜</strong>，它們會散落在世界各地。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1352/577/giant-pumking.png\" width=\"390\"><img style=\"float:right\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1352/583/medium-sized-pumkin.png\" width=\"390\"></p><p>在它們內部，你會發現<strong>小型地牢</strong>、<strong>怪物</strong>以及可供收集的<strong>恐怖戰利品</strong>。</p><p><strong>最大的南瓜</strong>擁有雙層地牢，充滿南瓜頭骷髏、細緻的恐怖氛圍、小型跑酷區域、獎勵戰利品以及一些隱藏寶箱。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1352/578/dungeon-chest.png\" width=\"390\"><img style=\"float:right\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1352/580/dungeon-jump-and-run.png\" width=\"390\"></p><p><strong>兩個較小的南瓜</strong>內部結構較簡單，但仍藏有骷髏與待發現的戰利品。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1352/584/smallest-pumpkin.png\" width=\"390\"><img style=\"float:right\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1352/582/second-pumpkin.png\" width=\"390\"></p><p>它們<strong>十分稀有</strong>，僅生成於<strong>森林</strong>、<strong>針葉林</strong>與<strong>平原</strong>生態域。</p><p>🎃 <strong>最適合恐怖季節的體驗！</strong> 🎃</p><hr><p>歡迎將本模組自由收錄於您的模組包中</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
